properties.description:
THIS IS A REWIRE BY FISHING METHODS ONLY
NO NEW BATHROOM, KITCHEN, OR FRAMING
THIS IS A PHDC REWIRE FOR A COMPLETE 2 STORY OCCUPIED PROPERTY. TO INCLUDE THE FOLLOWING SCOPE:
* UP TO 20 BRANCH CIRCUITS, 15A AND 20A, INCLUDING ALL CABLING, BOXES AND CONNECTORS
* UP TO 32 RECEPTACLES, TAMPER PROOF, INCLUDING ALL PROVISIONS FOR GFCIs IN BATHROOMS, LAUNDRY, AT PANEL, KITCHEN AND OUTDOOR RECEPTACLES
* UP TO 16 ROCKER SWITCHES, INCLUDING ALL NECESSARY 3-WAY SWITCHES;
*LIVING ROOM TO INCLUDE EITHER AN OVERHEAD LIGHT OR A SWITCHED RECEPTACLE;
*THREE-BULB FIXTURE IS REQUIRED FOR DINING ROOM.
*RECEPTACLES SHALL BE INCLUDED IN MASONRY WALLS, WHERE FEASIBLE, AT NO EXTRA COST;
*UP TO 4 FLUSH MOUNT CEILING LIGHT FIXTURES IN BASEMENT;
*UP TO 3 EXTERIOR LIGHT FIXTURES;
*UP TO 10 CEILING LIGHT FIXTURES;
*FRONT DOORBELL INCLUDED;
*5 ARC FAULT BREAKERS INCLUDED (EXTRA $74 PER BREAKER)
*UP TO 3 COMBO ARC FAULT BREAKERS
*UP TO 6 HARD WIRED SMOKE DETECTORS, TWO OF WHICH SHOULD BE SMOKE/CO COMBINATION (IN BASEMENT & 2ND FL HALL);

INCLUDE TWO CONTINUOUS PROPER GROUND RODS INSTALLATION AND CONNECTION, SEONDARY GROUND TO DOMESTIC WATER WITH JUMPER AT METER AND GFCI AT PANEL;

